{"id":"512a7d4f3a4d640b","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-topological-vector.md","title":"Topological Vector Space","display":"df-topological-vector — Topological Vector Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-topological-vector","aliases":["58-df-topological-vector","Topological Vector Space"],"display":"df-topological-vector — Topological Vector Space","depends_on":["[[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-topology.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-topological-vector"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-topological-vector</span><span>Topological Vector Space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-topological-vector — Topological Vector Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-topology.md\">../batch14/58-df-topology.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3cd1834de4f2efb2\" href=\"?note=3cd1834de4f2efb2\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md\">../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathbb K,\\tau_X,\\tau_{\\mathbb K},+,\\odot\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathbb K,\\tau_X,\\tau_{\\mathbb K},+,\\odot\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb K}\">\\(\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb K}\\)</span> (vector-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Top}\">\\(\\mathrm{Top}\\)</span> (topology predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-topology.md\">../batch14/58-df-topology.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\\)</span> (continuity predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3cd1834de4f2efb2\" href=\"?note=3cd1834de4f2efb2\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md\">../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TopologicalVectorSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TopologicalVectorSpace}_S\\)</span> (topological-vector-space predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProdTop}_S(X,\\tau,Y,\\sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{ProdTop}_S(X,\\tau,Y,\\sigma)\\)</span> 为本文件定义的二元乘积拓扑函数；其定义域由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\\land\\mathrm{Top}(\\sigma,Y)\">\\(\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\\land\\mathrm{Top}(\\sigma,Y)\\)</span> 给出。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\\land\\mathrm{Top}(\\sigma,Y)\\ \\to\\\n\\operatorname{ProdTop}_S(X,\\tau,Y,\\sigma)=\n\\left\\{W\\subseteq X\\times Y:\\forall\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in W\\;\\exists U\\in\\tau\\;\\exists V\\in\\sigma\\;\n(x\\in U\\land y\\in V\\land U\\times V\\subseteq W)\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\\land\\mathrm{Top}(\\sigma,Y)\\ \\to\\\n\\operatorname{ProdTop}_S(X,\\tau,Y,\\sigma)=\n\\left\\{W\\subseteq X\\times Y:\\forall\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in W\\;\\exists U\\in\\tau\\;\\exists V\\in\\sigma\\;\n(x\\in U\\land y\\in V\\land U\\times V\\subseteq W)\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{TopologicalVectorSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X,\\mathbb K,\\tau_{\\mathbb K})\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau_X,X)\\land\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau_{\\mathbb K},\\mathbb K)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists +,\\odot\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb K}(X,+,\\odot)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(+,X\\times X,\\operatorname{ProdTop}_S(X,\\tau_X,X,\\tau_X),X,\\tau_X)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(\\odot,\\mathbb K\\times X,\\operatorname{ProdTop}_S(\\mathbb K,\\tau_{\\mathbb K},X,\\tau_X),X,\\tau_X)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{TopologicalVectorSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X,\\mathbb K,\\tau_{\\mathbb K})\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau_X,X)\\land\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau_{\\mathbb K},\\mathbb K)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists +,\\odot\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb K}(X,+,\\odot)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(+,X\\times X,\\operatorname{ProdTop}_S(X,\\tau_X,X,\\tau_X),X,\\tau_X)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(\\odot,\\mathbb K\\times X,\\operatorname{ProdTop}_S(\\mathbb K,\\tau_{\\mathbb K},X,\\tau_X),X,\\tau_X)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TopologicalVectorSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X,\\mathbb K)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau_{\\mathbb K}\\in V\\;\\mathrm{TopologicalVectorSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X,\\mathbb K,\\tau_{\\mathbb K}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{TopologicalVectorSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X,\\mathbb K)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau_{\\mathbb K}\\in V\\;\\mathrm{TopologicalVectorSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X,\\mathbb K,\\tau_{\\mathbb K}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>In this atom Hausdorffness is not built into the core definition; authors who require Hausdorff topological vector spaces add that condition.</li>\n<li>Locally convex TVS: projective limit of normed spaces; bornological, barreled notions</li>\n<li>F-space: complete metrizable topological vector space; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^p\">\\(L^p\\)</span> for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0&lt;p&lt;1\">\\(0&lt;p&lt;1\\)</span> is non-locally-convex, whereas <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C(K)\">\\(C(K)\\)</span> with the supremum norm is Banach.</li>\n<li>Fréchet space: locally convex F-space; projective limit of Banach spaces</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\text{Hilbert}\\subsetneq\\text{Banach}\\subsetneq\\text{normed}\">\\(\\text{Hilbert}\\subsetneq\\text{Banach}\\subsetneq\\text{normed}\\)</span> in the usual inclusion hierarchy.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Rudin, Functional Analysis</li>\n<li>Conway, A Course in Functional Analysis</li>\n<li>Schaefer and Wolff, Topological Vector Spaces</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"e7514bc4cefba4f2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depen